<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>H5 - 标签 - DebugTalk</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/tags/H5/</link><description>DebugTalk</description><generator>Hugo 0.167.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-beta-mukxzari</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</managingEditor><webMaster>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://debugtalk.com/tags/H5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>关于促销活动页面测试的那些事儿</title><link>https://debugtalk.com/post/promotion-page-test/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 Jun 2016 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>mail@debugtalk.com (debugtalk)</author><guid>https://debugtalk.com/post/promotion-page-test/</guid><category domain="https://debugtalk.com/categories/Testing/">Testing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;这篇文章来说说促销活动页面测试的那些事儿。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="什么是促销活动页面"&gt;&lt;span&gt;什么是促销活动页面？&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%98%af%e4%bf%83%e9%94%80%e6%b4%bb%e5%8a%a8%e9%a1%b5%e9%9d%a2" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;通常电商平台在节假日会做一些促销活动，而活动的宣传方式，主要会采用H5静态页面的形式，也就是本文中要讲的促销活动页面。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>